:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Bondage Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased for 150 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Denmark (Empire of Cats)|Denmark]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. It was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] gains increased health, a chance to survive a [[Survive|lethal strike]] and [[Immune to Warp]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked from clearing Niigata in Chapter 2. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Bondage Cat is unlocked when clearing Denmark in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 75 Cat Food.

